-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ט/4: עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016 לעובדי הוראה
-- The 2016 shekel supplement of the kindergartens, primary and middle
-- divisions and teachers' colleges, linked to the consumer price index:
-- the monthly amounts for a full position from 1.1.2019, 1.6.2019 and
-- 1.9.2019, by the Ofek Hadash academic grade.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `חוזר תשע"ט/4 עדכון תוספת שקלית 2016`

-- akn:preamble/p1 akn:preamble/p2 akn:preamble/p3 akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10 akn:preamble/p11 akn:preamble/p12 The letterhead, date, reference, addressee, greeting and subject line; no rule.

-- akn:preamble/p13 akn:preamble/p14 akn:preamble/p15 The sources of the linkage (the agreements of 30.9.2016 and 19.3.2017, circulars 5777/3 and 5778/6), the supplement's payment in steps, and the circular's purpose from 1.1.2019 on; the amounts are encoded below.

-- ¶16: December 2018's index against December 2017's.
@ref akn:preamble/p16
GIVEN `index of December 2018` IS A NUMBER, `index of December 2017` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linkage factor` `index of December 2018` `index of December 2017` IS
    `index of December 2018` DIVIDED BY `index of December 2017`

DECLARE `stage of education` IS ONE OF
    `kindergarten`
    `primary school`
    `middle division`
    `teachers' college`
    `upper division`

@desc A teaching employee, as far as this circular asks.
DECLARE `teaching employee` HAS
    `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS A BOOLEAN
    `stage` IS A `stage of education`
    `academic grade` IS A NUMBER @desc the grade in the Ofek Hadash salary tables for academic teachers (1, 1.5, ... 4.5); 0 for any other placement, in Ofek Hadash or outside it

-- akn:preamble/p17 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.

@ref akn:preamble/p18 akn:preamble/p19
GIVEN e IS A `teaching employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the circular applies to` e IF
        e's `rated in the teaching employees' grading`
    AND e's `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution`
    AND NOT e's `stage` EQUALS `upper division`

@desc A printed amount: the period, the academic grade (0 = all others), and the amount for a full position.
DECLARE `printed amount` HAS
    `amount from`  IS A DATE
    `amount to`    IS A DATE @desc 31.12.9999 where no end is given
    `for grade`    IS A NUMBER
    `full-position amount` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_a akn:art_a/p2 akn:art_a/p3
`the amounts from 1.1.2019` MEANS
    LIST `printed amount` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 31 5 2019) 1   343.58,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 31 5 2019) 1.5 322.98,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 31 5 2019) 2   302.39,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 31 5 2019) 2.5 248.99,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 1 2019) (Date 31 5 2019) 0   195.58

@ref akn:art_b akn:art_b/p2 akn:art_b/p3
`the amounts from 1.6.2019` MEANS
    LIST `printed amount` (Date 1 6 2019) (Date 31 8 2019) 1   654.98,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 6 2019) (Date 31 8 2019) 1.5 634.38,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 6 2019) (Date 31 8 2019) 2   613.79,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 6 2019) (Date 31 8 2019) 2.5 560.39,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 6 2019) (Date 31 8 2019) 0   506.99

@ref akn:art_c akn:art_c/p2 akn:art_c/p3
`the amounts from 1.9.2019` MEANS
    LIST `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 1   738.15,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 1.5 710.78,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 2   683.42,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 2.5 650.30,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 3   617.19,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 3.5 599.45,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 4   581.73,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 4.5 544.36,
         `printed amount` (Date 1 9 2019) (Date 31 12 9999) 0   506.99

`all the printed amounts` MEANS
    concat (LIST `the amounts from 1.1.2019`, `the amounts from 1.6.2019`, `the amounts from 1.9.2019`)

GIVEN `the day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A LIST OF `printed amount`
DECIDE `the amounts in force on` `the day` IS
    filter (GIVEN a YIELD `the day` AT LEAST a's `amount from` AND `the day` AT MOST a's `amount to`) `all the printed amounts`

-- A grade the period's list names takes its amount; any other placement
-- takes the "all others" amount.
@export default The CPI-linked 2016 shekel supplement for a full position on a day from 1 January 2019, for a teaching employee in kindergarten, primary, middle division or a teachers' college, under the owners' circular 5779/4
@ref akn:art_a akn:art_b akn:art_c
GIVEN e IS A `teaching employee` @desc the employee
      `the day` IS A DATE @desc the day the supplement is paid for
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` e `the day` IS
    IF NOT `the circular applies to` e
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF any (GIVEN a YIELD a's `for grade` EQUALS e's `academic grade`) (`the amounts in force on` `the day`)
              AND e's `academic grade` GREATER THAN 0
         THEN sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `full-position amount`)
                       (filter (GIVEN a YIELD a's `for grade` EQUALS e's `academic grade`) (`the amounts in force on` `the day`)))
         ELSE sum (map (GIVEN a YIELD a's `full-position amount`)
                       (filter (GIVEN a YIELD a's `for grade` EQUALS 0) (`the amounts in force on` `the day`)))

-- akn:art_c/p4 akn:art_c/p5 A pointer to circular 5777/3 for the supplement's other rules; no rule of its own.

DECLARE `linkage action` IS ONE OF
    `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` HAS `indemnity` IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_c/p6
GIVEN `indemnity due` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `linkage action`
DECIDE `indemnifying the owners` `indemnity due` IS
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education`
    MUST  `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `indemnity due`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off and the copies list; no rule.

-- Examples.
`a grade-3 teacher` MEANS `teaching employee` WITH
    `rated in the teaching employees' grading` IS TRUE
    `employed by an owner of a ministry-supervised institution` IS TRUE
    `stage` IS `middle division`
    `academic grade` IS 3

-- Grade 3 is named only from 1.9.2019; before, it is among "all others".
#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `a grade-3 teacher` (Date 1 7 2019) EQUALS 506.99
#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `a grade-3 teacher` (Date 1 10 2019) EQUALS 617.19
#ASSERT `the linked shekel supplement for a full position` `a grade-3 teacher` (Date 1 2 2019) EQUALS 195.58

#TRACE `indemnifying the owners` 80 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Ministry of Education` DOES `indemnify the owner at the hour costs` 80 AT 1
